Source: freebuff-desktop
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), binutils, xz-utils, zstd
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://freebuff.com

Package: freebuff-desktop
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libgtk-3-0t64, libnotify4, libnss3, libxss1, libxtst6, xdg-utils, libatspi2.0-0t64, libuuid1, libsecret-1-0
# Upstream's Recommends: libappindicator3-1 is dead on both targets
# (apt-cache policy Candidate=(none) on testing+sid, package removed from
# the Debian archives) and the shipped binary has 0 appindicator string
# references - dropped rather than carried as unsatisfiable metadata.
Description: Freebuff Desktop
 Freebuff Desktop re-packs the upstream .deb payload under /opt.
